	/* Kjeldoran Outpost	""
	 * Land
	 * If ~ would enter the battlefield, sacrifice |Ha Plains instead. If you do, put ~ onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard.
	 * |T: Add |W to your mana pool.
